{"path":"/zh/concepts/intent-as-compilation/","title":"意图编译：从自然语言到控制信号","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-195a255db7eb1bf3-1","revision":"195a255db7eb1bf384894cdfe84ab943c9c1e6c99d9917011130f7bcfb548e32","tag":"p","quote":"“帮新加坡研发团队把下月计薪准备好”对人很清楚，对程序却不是可执行的路由。系统需要把它收敛为已知动作，例如 create_pay_group，同时提取团队、期间和待确认规则。"},{"block_id":"adps-fd85b2221807e46d-1","revision":"fd85b2221807e46d77fc48a5d98f5b407bbf8867055e379d14c7f62599d5ea0f","tag":"p","quote":"这个转换还必须能失败。当请求同时包含“查询”和“修改”，或缺少必要范围时，编译结果应进入 unknown 或澄清分支，不应猜一个工具开始执行。"},{"block_id":"adps-2753299c1ee9b996-1","revision":"2753299c1ee9b9969fcb6ac93c5dc58db64709f35d5d9933a637d3e3305fc26a","tag":"p","quote":"意图编译把自然语言请求转换为编排器可以读取的离散控制信号。模型输出结构化对象，程序验证后将其映射到有限枚举。"},{"block_id":"adps-05f8749f01edbf93-1","revision":"05f8749f01edbf938bd7bbc0b9ac5e695a27db8fd86cf59abc04368b40dcf8dc","tag":"pre","quote":"{ \"intent\": \"resolve\", \"confidence\": 0.91, \"reason\": \"需要配置薪资组并调用业务工具\" }"},{"block_id":"adps-0c0ee9e9b123b74c-1","revision":"0c0ee9e9b123b74cbdfd7b3f9b50ccaf0d6b7b4859a28a8404efa4f24e6d063c","tag":"p","quote":"这一步的产物是路由输入，不是面向用户的回复。"},{"block_id":"adps-c51c63e16f90dd98-1","revision":"c51c63e16f90dd9897ab66f0ed4c55b335eff3032fd0acfe91f0282c035dd8f5","tag":"li","quote":"明确的意图枚举和字段 Schema；"},{"block_id":"adps-1c38772761187aa0-1","revision":"1c38772761187aa0f310bd866e0603925944e67fba9eb2f911d2a45c8374a0fb","tag":"li","quote":"解析失败时的 unknown；"},{"block_id":"adps-e12557e1cacf1e98-1","revision":"e12557e1cacf1e98e27258bf6778aafcaf8395839636208863399b4ac755e53d","tag":"li","quote":"与下游执行链的一对一映射；"},{"block_id":"adps-553416ff0bc0c86c-1","revision":"553416ff0bc0c86ce1501814390d00eac683a270160e51ea28f506e7a28170b9","tag":"li","quote":"输入、模型版本、输出和路由结果的审计记录。"},{"block_id":"adps-1daf8999d1e26817-1","revision":"1daf8999d1e2681737996a6a35aaf1fd81f8219f771fb3db3c5db986c044e98f","tag":"p","quote":"程序只接受已注册的枚举值。模型返回未知类型、缺少字段或置信度不足时，进入澄清或兜底分支，不能自由构造新的执行路径。"},{"block_id":"adps-ed304e22676f7b59-1","revision":"ed304e22676f7b595437aa932db473464d601a0daef7cf8583d12ad3c7495e0b","tag":"p","quote":"东方屹腾早期定义了三类信号："},{"block_id":"adps-143509b0ce9487fc-1","revision":"143509b0ce9487fcd023e5187e4268e8eb0842aa5d32346e663e5cec307a7125","tag":"li","quote":"analyze：业务知识分析；"},{"block_id":"adps-7c0d231cc90323b2-1","revision":"7c0d231cc90323b2afb4255f978e1221583ffb62d498dd13555bbc9fa067e908","tag":"li","quote":"resolve：需要推理和工具执行的任务。"},{"block_id":"adps-32a3973c14cb5de3-1","revision":"32a3973c14cb5de39fc95ef33385aa5209f4e7e3370a681e2c5a873bba529a43","tag":"p","quote":"解析失败统一标记为 unknown。随着业务扩展，枚举演化为 task、information、produce、chat 等类型。意图网关根据枚举选择不同执行链，叙事结论则写入 ReasonContext。"},{"block_id":"adps-f77ec34bbc0c06bf-1","revision":"f77ec34bbc0c06bfe676e0f6cfef056442a4ea90bdea92435574627a54be1bb1","tag":"p","quote":"当自然语言请求需要进入确定的业务流程时，应在入口处生成并校验控制信号。信号消费者见Orchestrator 与 MessageHandler，运行时分层原则见控制平面与叙事平面。"},{"block_id":"adps-6f383e93b8d68765-1","revision":"6f383e93b8d68765ef75becf3f85f392b03eff290889d4b6b29128cd1e90d03e","tag":"p","quote":"初始来源：东方屹腾执行型 Agent 案例报告；案例提供：梁博（Bo Liang）。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
